<div class="faq">

    <div class="faq__text">
        <span class="faq__tag">F.A.Q</span>
        <h2 class="faq__title heading-h2">Answers to Your Questions</h2>
        <button class="faq__button button button--secondary button--lg">Ask Us A Question</button>
    </div>

    <div class="faq__accordion">

    
        <details class="faq__item">
            <summary class="faq__question">Can I request a refund?</summary>
            <p class="faq__answer">
            Refund policies vary. Please check the specific terms associated with your purchase.
            </p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq__item" open>
            <summary class="faq__question">How do I access my purchased products?</summary>
            <p class="faq__answer">
                Accessing your purchased products is seamless and hassle-free on our digital design assets marketplace. Simply log in to your account, navigate to the 'My Purchases' section, and you'll find all your purchased products ready for download.
            </p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq__item">
            <summary class="faq__question">Are there any discounts for bulk purchases?</summary>
            <p class="faq__answer">
                Yes, we offer special discounts for bulk purchases. Contact our sales team for more information.
            </p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq__item">
            <summary class="faq__question">What payment methods do you accept here?</summary>
            <p class="faq__answer">
                We accept credit cards, PayPal, and other popular payment methods.
            </p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq__item">
            <summary class="faq__question">Can I sell my digital products on this marketplace?</summary>
            <p class="faq__answer">
                Yes, you can apply to become a seller. Check out the 'Sell With Us' page for details.
            </p>
        </details>

    </div>


    
</div>